edback from socials, here's what's improved:Subtitles and video control added to the tapesDog now barks when it wants to go outside or come back inFixed a visual issue with the window being opened by the wifeWrong wife head now snaps to look and follow youWrong wife can now spawn upstairs Increased Wife travel time (takes longer for her to change location when arrived)Fixed visual issues with the front porch when Wife walked inFixed issue where footsteps would keep playing when ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T14:58:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681812","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:31:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5151880-1846651706674088","game_id":"steam-5151880","kind":"announcement","title":"She'll Be Home Soon Demo Is Out!","summary":"Hey guys,Having reached 100 hours into development and being on time for the Steamfest, I've released the first demo build of She'll Be Home Soon to the public.Feel free to give it a play (also anyone who can beat The Family Visits challenge mode deserves a pat on the back because that took me way too long to beat). Any constructive feedback is always appreciated as I've already made and plan to make changes based on feedback I've gotten so far on my socials.The goal is to have the full game rel","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T12:03:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674088","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:31:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5151880-1845383656392965","game_id":"steam-5151880","kind":"announcement","title":"My Wife's Family Is Out To Kill Me","summary":"Hey guys,This fortnight I introduced the wrong mother-in-law, challenge modes and upped the difficulty 